<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3398699&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606379366" alt="Gaster Master" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3398699)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;">Gaster Master</a></span></p>
